v class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 transition-colors hover:bg-canvas/60\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"Mark &quot;Vendor API credentials&quot; as done\" class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md border transition-all duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 border-line bg-white group-hover:border-accent/50\"></button><div><p class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold leading-tight text-ink\">Vendor API credentials</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-tight text-muted\">Compliance Audit Q3 · File requested</p></div></div><span class=\"flex-none rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[12.5px] font-semibold transition-colors duration-200 bg-accent-lt text-accent-dk\">Action needed</span></div><div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 transition-colors hover:bg-canvas/60\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"Mark &quot;Expand controls testing&quot; as done\" class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md border transition-all duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 border-line bg-white group-hover:border-accent/50\"></button><div><p class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold leading-tight text-ink\">Expand controls testing</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-tight text-muted\">Include Q2 retroactively</p></div></div><span class=\"flex-none rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[12.5px] font-semibold transition-colors duration-200 bg-canvas text-muted\">In review</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-accent-lt px-5 py-4\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.2 6.8L21 11l-6.8 2.2L12 20l-2.2-6.8L3 11l6.8-2.2L12 2z\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-accent-dk\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">PYNGYN flagged 1 item at risk:</span> the signature is 2 days overdue and the next client session is Friday.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"dark-panel relative overflow-hidden py-16\"><div class=\"hero-grid pointer-events-none absolute inset-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"wrap relative\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><p class=\"mb-10 text-center text-sm text-white/60\">Our partners</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"relative h-16 overflow-hidden\" style=\"mask-image:linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 6%, black 94%, transparent);-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 6%, black 94%, transparent)\"><div class=\"flex h-16 w-max animate-marquee hover:[animation-play-state:paused] motion-reduce:animate-none\"><div class=\"flex h-16 w-max flex-none items-center gap-16 pr-16\"><img alt=\"Hashtag Consultancy\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"183\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-11 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/hashtag-consultancy.png\"/><img alt=\"GetReplies\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"116\" height=\"26\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/getreplies.png\"/><img alt=\"Zoem International\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-16 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/zoem-international.png\"/><img alt=\"Remote Talent\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"828\" height=\"195\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-9 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/remote-talent.png\"/><img alt=\"Tagioni School of Performing Arts\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-16 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/tagioni.png\"/><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f0b84b] text-[13px] font-bold text-black\">BB</span><span class=\"flex flex-col leading-tight\"><span class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-white\">BigBirdLuxe</span><span class=\"text-[12px] text-white/50\">Elevated Living</span></span></div></div><div class=\"flex h-16 w-max flex-none items-center gap-16 pr-16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"183\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-11 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/hashtag-consultancy.png\"/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"116\" height=\"26\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-8 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/getreplies.png\"/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-16 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/zoem-international.png\"/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"828\" height=\"195\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-9 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/remote-talent.png\"/><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-16 w-auto shrink-0 opacity-90 transition-opacity hover:opacity-100\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/partners/tagioni.png\"/><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#f0b84b] text-[13px] font-bold text-black\">BB</span><span class=\"flex flex-col leading-tight\"><span class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-white\">BigBirdLuxe</span><span class=\"text-[12px] text-white/50\">Elevated Living</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"proof\" class=\"section-tight\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><p class=\"mb-7 text-center text-sm text-muted\">Built for professional-services and consulting firms</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-3\"><a class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" href=\"/solutions/consultants/\">Consulting</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" href=\"/solutions/accountants/\">CA &amp; accounting</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" href=\"/solutions/creative-services/\">Agencies</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" href=\"/solutions/lawyers/\">Legal</a><a class=\"rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-muted transition-colors hover:border-accent hover:text-accent\" href=\"/solutions/architects/\">Architecture</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>The problem</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3 max-w-[720px]\">Your clients are in the dark.</h2><p class=\"lead mt-4 max-w-[620px]\">Most firms still run client communication through email. Clients can&#x27;t see anything without asking, so you become the bottleneck between them and their own information.</p></div><div class=\"mt-[46px] overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-line\"><div class=\"grid gap-px bg-line sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white p-8\"><div class=\"mb-5 font-mono text-[13px] font-medium text-accent\">01</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold italic tracking-[-0.01em]\">Clients in the dark</h3><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Clients can&#x27;t see anything without asking, so they ask constantly. “Any update?” “Did you get my email?”, and the work stops while you answer.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white p-8\"><div class=\"mb-5 font-mono text-[13px] font-medium text-accent\">02</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold italic tracking-[-0.01em]\">Clients feel forgotten</h3><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Firms rarely lose clients over the work. They lose them because clients feel ignored between conversations, never sure what&#x27;s happening or what comes next.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white p-8\"><div class=\"mb-5 font-mono text-[13px] font-medium text-accent\">03</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold italic tracking-[-0.01em]\">Email everywhere</h3><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Documents, approvals, and decisions are scattered across inboxes and WhatsApp, unsecured, untraceable, and impossible to find when you need them.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white p-8\"><div class=\"mb-5 font-mono text-[13px] font-medium text-accent\">04</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold italic tracking-[-0.01em]\">Decision fog</h3><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">A scope change agreed six months ago affects today&#x27;s delivery. Nobody remembers what was decided, why, or who approved it.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white p-8\"><div class=\"mb-5 font-mono text-[13px] font-medium text-accent\">05</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold italic tracking-[-0.01em]\">Budget blindness</h3><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">A partner does not know if a project is profitable until the invoice goes out. By then the overrun has already happened.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white p-8\"><div class=\"mb-5 font-mono text-[13px] font-medium text-accent\">06</div><h3 class=\"mb-3 font-display text-[22px] font-semibold italic tracking-[-0.01em]\">Knowledge walks out</h3><p class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">A senior leaves and takes five years of client context with them. Nobody wrote it down. The next engagement starts from zero.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[680px] text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>How PYNGYN works</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">A branded portal for every client.</h2><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-4\">Clientspace is what your clients log into: a complete, standalone product that replaces the email threads and status calls that eat your week.</p></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-[46px] max-w-[720px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"flex h-full flex-col rounded-[20px] border border-accent/25 bg-accent-lt p-7 shadow-card sm:p-9\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent text-white\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.2\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></circle><path d=\"M3.5 19c0-3 2.5-4.6 5.5-4.6s5.5 1.6 5.5 4.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M16 5.5a3.2 3.2 0 010 5M18.5 19c0-2.2-1-3.8-2.6-4.4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-white/60 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-accent\">The client portal</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink\">Clientspace</h3><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink/70\">A branded, secure portal for every client. They see their status, documents, approvals, and invoices 24/7, so they stop emailing you for updates and start self-serving, while you stay fully in control of what they see.</p><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-2 text-[14px] text-ink/80\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4 4 10-10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Branded as your firm, one space per client</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4 4 10-10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Live status, documents, and approvals</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4 4 10-10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>One-click access, no password for clients</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12.5l4 4 10-10\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg>Clients see only their own engagement</li></ul><a class=\"btn btn-accent mt-6 self-start\" href=\"/clientspace/\">Explore Clientspace</a></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><p class=\"mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[680px] text-center text-[14px] text-muted\">Also want to run projects and billable time internally?<!-- --> <a class=\"font-semibold text-accent hover:underline\" href=\"/workspace/\">Workspace</a> <!-- -->is available as an add-on.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Why PYNGYN</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">Three reasons firms switch.</h2></div></div><div class=\"mt-[46px] grid gap-[22px] md:grid-cols-3\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"mb-[18px] grid h-[46px] w-[46px] place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-lt text-[22px] text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◈</div><h3 class=\"mb-2.5 font-display text-[21px] font-semibold\">Clients stop chasing you</h3><p class=\"text-[15.5px] text-muted\">Every client gets a branded portal where they see status, documents, and approvals 24/7, so the “any update?” emails stop and you stop being the bottleneck.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"mb-[18px] grid h-[46px] w-[46px] place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-lt text-[22px] text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✶</div><h3 class=\"mb-2.5 font-display text-[21px] font-semibold\">You look buttoned-up</h3><p class=\"text-[15.5px] text-muted\">A white-labeled portal in your firm&#x27;s name makes every client feel informed and in control. Clients leave firms that ignore them; this keeps them close.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"card h-full\"><div class=\"mb-[18px] grid h-[46px] w-[46px] place-items-center rounded-xl bg-accent-lt text-[22px] text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◉</div><h3 class=\"mb-2.5 font-display text-[21px] font-semibold\">Nothing runs on email</h3><p class=\"text-[15.5px] text-muted\">Documents, approvals, and messages live in one secure place per client (encrypted, audit-trailed, and isolated), instead of scattered across unsecured inboxes.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"how\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>How it works</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">A client portal live in minutes.</h2></div></div><div class=\"mt-[50px] grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-line md:grid-cols-3\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white p-8\"><span class=\"index-num\">01</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 mt-5 text-[19px] font-bold\">Create the Clientspace</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Spin up a branded portal for a client in a couple of clicks, your logo, your colors, your domain.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white p-8\"><span class=\"index-num\">02</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 mt-5 text-[19px] font-bold\">Invite the client</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Send a magic link. They click once and they&#x27;re in, no password, no setup on their end.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"h-full bg-white p-8\"><span class=\"index-num\">03</span><h3 class=\"mb-2 mt-5 text-[19px] font-bold\">They self-serve, 24/7</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Status, documents, approvals, and invoices are all there. The “any update?” emails stop, and your team keeps the picture current from Workspace.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"text-center\"><h2 class=\"title mx-auto max-w-[760px]\">Built for every <span class=\"text-accent\">professional-services firm</span></h2><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-4\">However your firm works, PYNGYN runs the engagement and keeps it on track.</p></div><div class=\"mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2.5\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" class=\"rounded-full border px-5 py-2.5 text-[15px] font-semibold transition-all border-accent bg-white text-accent shadow-card\">Lawyers</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-5 py-2.5 text-[15px] font-semibold transition-all border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-ink/30\">Accountants</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-5 py-2.5 text-[15px] font-semibold transition-all border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-ink/30\">Marketing Consultants</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-5 py-2.5 text-[15px] font-semibold transition-all border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-ink/30\">Creative Services</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" class=\"rounded-full border px-5 py-2.5 text-[15px] font-semibold transition-all border-line bg-white text-ink hover:border-ink/30\">Architects</button></div><div class=\"mt-9 overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-[#f6f7fb] p-6 md:p-12\"><div class=\"grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px)\"><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-[clamp(28px,3.6vw,42px)] font-semibold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.025em]\">Run every matter<br/><span class=\"text-muted\">from intake to filing</span></h3><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[460px] text-[16px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Manage matters, deadlines, and client communication in one place, with PYNGYN tracking every filing date and deliverable.</p><ul class=\"mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[15.5px]\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-lt text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>Track matters and court deadlines</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[15.5px]\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-lt text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>Keep client documents and approvals in order</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[15.5px]\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-lt text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>Flag filings at risk before the deadline</li></ul><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary mt-8 w-fit\">Explore solution →</a></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-white shadow-card\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-line px-4 py-3\"><span class=\"h-[10px] w-[10px] rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"h-[10px] w-[10px] rounded-full bg-[#febc2e]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"h-[10px] w-[10px] rounded-full bg-[#28c840]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"ml-2 text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-[#9aa0ad]\">Acme Corp v. Dalton · Matter</span><span class=\"ml-auto text-[10.5px] font-medium text-muted/70\">Try it, click a task</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-[#f1f1f5] px-4 py-2.5 text-[13.5px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(12px)\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"Open matter &amp; conflicts check\" class=\"grid h-4 w-4 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded border-2 transition-colors hover:border-accent border-positive bg-positive\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cursor-pointer text-left font-medium\">Open matter &amp; conflicts check</button><span class=\"ml-auto rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] text-[10.5px] font-semibold bg-[#e6f5ee] text-positive\">Done</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-[#f1f1f5] px-4 py-2.5 text-[13.5px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(12px)\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"Draft complaint\" class=\"grid h-4 w-4 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded border-2 transition-colors hover:border-accent border-line\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cursor-pointer text-left font-medium\">Draft complaint</button><span class=\"ml-auto rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] text-[10.5px] font-semibold bg-accent-lt text-accent-dk\">In progress</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-[#f1f1f5] px-4 py-2.5 text-[13.5px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(12px)\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"Compile evidence &amp; exhibits\" class=\"grid h-4 w-4 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded border-2 transition-colors hover:border-accent border-line\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cursor-pointer text-left font-medium\">Compile evidence &amp; exhibits</button><span class=\"ml-auto rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] text-[10.5px] font-semibold bg-accent-lt text-accent-dk\">In progress</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-b border-[#f1f1f5] px-4 py-2.5 text-[13.5px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(12px)\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"File with court &amp; serve\" class=\"grid h-4 w-4 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded border-2 transition-colors hover:border-accent border-line\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"cursor-pointer text-left font-medium\">File with court &amp; serve</button><span class=\"ml-auto rounded-full px-2 py-[2px] text-[10.5px] font-semibold bg-[#fdecea] text-[#b9281f]\">At risk</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2 px-4 py-3 text-[12px] bg-accent-lt text-accent-dk\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-0.5 flex-none\"><path d=\"M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg>PYNGYN flagged 1 task at risk: filing depends on client sign-off, which is 2 days behind.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[680px] text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Inside PYNGYN</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">The actual product. Not a mockup.</h2><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-4\">Real screens from Clientspace and Workspace, the two products your firm and clients use every day.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><figure class=\"mx-auto mt-[46px] max-w-[1000px]\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-art\"><img alt=\"PYNGYN Clientspace showing a client&#x27;s branded portal with needs-your-attention items, active engagements, engagement value, and upcoming sessions at a glance\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1909\" height=\"940\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/screens/clientspace-space.webp\"/></div><figcaption class=\"mt-3 text-center text-[13px] text-muted\">Your client&#x27;s Clientspace: engagements, approvals, and status in one branded portal.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"mt-[72px] space-y-[72px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"grid items-center gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-12\"><div class=\"md:order-2\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-accent\">Business Brain</span><h3 class=\"mt-2.5 font-display text-[clamp(24px,3vw,32px)] font-semibold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.02em]\">AI triages everything that needs you.</h3><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[480px] text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">Smart Inbox sorts client replies, approvals, and updates into Needs response, FYI, and Low priority, each with a one-line reason, so partners spend their time deciding, not sifting through a feed.</p></div><div class=\"md:order-1\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-line bg-white shadow-art\"><img alt=\"PYNGYN Smart Inbox, AI-triaged, sorting items into Needs response, FYI, and Low priority with a one-line reason and confidence score for each\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"949\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-auto w-full\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/screens/smart-inbox.webp\"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-tight\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[640px] text-center\"><p class=\"eyebrow justify-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Before / after</p><h2 class=\"title mt-4\">Why client work falls through the cracks.</h2><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-4\">More clients, more stakeholders, more tools bolted together over time. Drag the slider to see what changes when it all runs through one system instead.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"mt-12\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10.5] w-full select-none overflow-hidden rounded-[20px] border border-line bg-white shadow-art sm:aspect-[16/8.5]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 grid place-items-center bg-canvas p-4 sm:p-8\"><div class=\"w-full max-w-[560px]\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-white shadow-art\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line px-5 py-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex gap-1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#febc2e]\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#28c840]\"></span></div><span class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold text-ink\">Compliance Audit Q3 <span class=\"font-normal text-muted\">· Engagement</span></span></div><span class=\"hidden text-[12.5px] text-muted sm:inline\">Client view</span></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-line\"><div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 transition-colors hover:bg-canvas/60\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"Mark &quot;Engagement letter&quot; as done\" class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md border transition-all duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 border-line bg-white group-hover:border-accent/50\"></button><div><p class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold leading-tight text-ink\">Engagement letter</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-tight text-muted\">Compliance Audit Q3 · Agreement</p></div></div><span class=\"flex-none rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[12.5px] font-semibold transition-colors duration-200 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700\">Awaiting signature</span></div><div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 transition-colors hover:bg-canvas/60\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"Mark &quot;Change Request #CR-001&quot; as not done\" class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md border transition-all duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 border-emerald-500 bg-emerald-500\"><svg width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\" stroke=\"white\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></button><div><p class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold leading-tight text-ink\">Change Request #CR-001</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-tight text-muted\">Compliance Audit Q3 · Addendum</p></div></div><span class=\"flex-none rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[12.5px] font-semibold transition-colors duration-200 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700\">Signed ✓</span></div><div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 transition-colors hover:bg-canvas/60\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"Mark &quot;Vendor API credentials&quot; as done\" class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md border transition-all duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 border-line bg-white group-hover:border-accent/50\"></button><div><p class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold leading-tight text-ink\">Vendor API credentials</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-tight text-muted\">Compliance Audit Q3 · File requested</p></div></div><span class=\"flex-none rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[12.5px] font-semibold transition-colors duration-200 bg-accent-lt text-accent-dk\">Action needed</span></div><div class=\"group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 px-5 py-4 transition-colors hover:bg-canvas/60\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3.5\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" aria-label=\"Mark &quot;Expand controls testing&quot; as done\" class=\"grid h-6 w-6 flex-none cursor-pointer place-items-center rounded-md border transition-all duration-150 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 border-line bg-white group-hover:border-accent/50\"></button><div><p class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold leading-tight text-ink\">Expand controls testing</p><p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[13px] leading-tight text-muted\">Include Q2 retroactively</p></div></div><span class=\"flex-none rounded-full px-3 py-1.5 text-[12.5px] font-semibold transition-colors duration-200 bg-canvas text-muted\">In review</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 bg-accent-lt px-5 py-4\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 2l2.2 6.8L21 11l-6.8 2.2L12 20l-2.2-6.8L3 11l6.8-2.2L12 2z\"></path></svg></span><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-accent-dk\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">PYNGYN flagged 1 item at risk:</span> the signature is 2 days overdue and the next client session is Friday.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"clip-path:inset(0 50% 0 0)\"><div class=\"relative h-full w-full overflow-hidden bg-canvas\"><div class=\"absolute w-[46%] max-w-[230px] rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2 shadow-card -rotate-3\" style=\"top:6%;left:6%\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-muted\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h16v12H4z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 7l8 6 8-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate text-[11px] font-medium\">Gmail · attachment</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 truncate text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">Proposal_final_v3.pdf</p></div><div class=\"absolute w-[46%] max-w-[230px] rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2 shadow-card rotate-2\" style=\"top:2%;left:46%\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-muted\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16v11H9l-4 4V16H4z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate text-[11px] font-medium\">WhatsApp thread</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 truncate text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">&quot;did we sign this yet?&quot;</p></div><div class=\"absolute w-[46%] max-w-[230px] rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2 shadow-card rotate-1\" style=\"top:34%;left:2%\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-muted\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></rect><path d=\"M4 10h16M10 4v16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate text-[11px] font-medium\">Downloads folder</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 truncate text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">Pricing_ACME_v7.xlsx</p></div><div class=\"absolute w-[46%] max-w-[230px] rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2 shadow-card -rotate-1\" style=\"top:40%;left:52%\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-muted\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h16v12H4z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M4 7l8 6 8-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate text-[11px] font-medium\">Gmail · unread</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 truncate text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">Re: Re: Re: status update</p></div><div class=\"absolute w-[46%] max-w-[230px] rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2 shadow-card -rotate-2\" style=\"top:66%;left:10%\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-muted\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16v11H9l-4 4V16H4z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate text-[11px] font-medium\">Slack DM</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 truncate text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">call recording link</p></div><div class=\"absolute w-[46%] max-w-[230px] rounded-[10px] border border-line bg-white px-3 py-2 shadow-card rotate-2\" style=\"top:70%;left:44%\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-muted\"><svg width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></rect><path d=\"M4 10h16M10 4v16\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate text-[11px] font-medium\">Shared drive</span></div><p class=\"mt-1 truncate text-[12.5px] font-semibold text-ink\">Engagement_tracker_FINAL2.xlsx</p></div></div></div><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-3 rounded-full border border-line bg-white/90 px-3 py-1 text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted backdrop-blur\">Old way</span><span class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-3 top-3 rounded-full border border-accent/30 bg-accent-lt/90 px-3 py-1 text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-accent-dk backdrop-blur\">New way</span><div class=\"absolute inset-y-0 z-10 w-[2px] bg-white shadow-[0_0_0_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)]\" style=\"left:50%\"><div role=\"slider\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Drag to compare old way and new way\" aria-valuenow=\"50\" aria-valuemin=\"4\" aria-valuemax=\"96\" class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 grid h-11 w-11 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 cursor-ew-resize place-items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-white text-ink shadow-cta transition-transform hover:scale-105 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 6l-5 6 5 6M15 6l5 6-5 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-12 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-16\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 flex-none place-items-center rounded-[10px] bg-amber-50 text-amber-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"></circle><path d=\"M12 8v5M12 16h.01\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink\">Old way</h3></div><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Status scattered across WhatsApp, email, and spreadsheets — nobody has the full picture before a client call.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>SOPs and client context live in one partner&#x27;s head. When they&#x27;re out, work slows down.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Deadlines slip silently — risk is invisible until it&#x27;s already cost you the date.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Scope creeps between formal change orders. The firm quietly absorbs the cost.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Several people are &quot;on&quot; a task, but nobody really owns it.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-amber-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>You learn a project was unprofitable after the invoice goes out.</li></ul></div><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><span class=\"grid h-9 w-9 flex-none place-items-center rounded-[10px] bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"text-[18px] font-semibold text-ink\">New way</h3></div><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-4\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>One branded Clientspace per engagement — client and team see the same live status.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>A living knowledge base surfaces SOPs and client history exactly when they matter.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>AI risk detection flags what threatens dates and margin, days earlier.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Change requests and approvals are tracked in the open, not absorbed in silence.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Every task has a clear, visible owner from the moment it&#x27;s created.</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted\"><span class=\"mt-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-none rounded-full bg-emerald-500\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Live engagement health, so margin problems surface weeks before the invoice.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Customer stories</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">Hear it from the teams using it.</h2><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[620px]\">A real customer, in their own words, on what changed once the busywork moved to PYNGYN.</p></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto mt-[46px] max-w-[560px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><figure><div class=\"relative aspect-video overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-black border border-line shadow-card\"><video class=\"h-full w-full object-contain\" controls=\"\" preload=\"metadata\" playsInline=\"\" aria-label=\"Customer testimonial\"><source src=\"https://pyngyn.ai/assets/Testimonial-CRAqvVm9.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"/>Your browser does not support embedded video. You can<!-- --> <a href=\"https://pyngyn.ai/assets/Testimonial-CRAqvVm9.mp4\" class=\"underline\">watch it here</a>.</video></div></figure></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>From the firms we build for</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">Made for how services firms run.</h2><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-4 max-w-[640px]\">How professional-services and consulting firms put Clientspace and Workspace to work. Roles only, no names.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-[46px] grid gap-[22px] md:grid-cols-3\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><figure class=\"card flex h-full flex-col\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\">Professional services</span><blockquote class=\"mt-3 flex-1 text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed\">“<!-- -->We finally see whether an engagement is profitable while it&#x27;s running, not after the invoice. We price and staff client work completely differently now.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mt-5 border-t border-line pt-3.5 text-[13.5px] text-muted\">Partner, advisory firm</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><figure class=\"card flex h-full flex-col\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\">Professional services</span><blockquote class=\"mt-3 flex-1 text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed\">“<!-- -->Clients open their own Clientspace and see exactly where things stand without emailing us. Our partner review stopped being a status-chasing meeting.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mt-5 border-t border-line pt-3.5 text-[13.5px] text-muted\">Managing Partner, accounting firm</figcaption></figure></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><figure class=\"card flex h-full flex-col\"><span class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-muted\">Professional services</span><blockquote class=\"mt-3 flex-1 text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed\">“<!-- -->Internal work and client work finally live in one place. When a senior leaves, five years of client context doesn&#x27;t walk out the door with them.<!-- -->”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mt-5 border-t border-line pt-3.5 text-[13.5px] text-muted\">Operations lead, consulting firm</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-tight\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"rounded-[28px] bg-accent px-8 py-14 shadow-soft\"><div class=\"grid gap-[18px] sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"font-display text-[46px] font-semibold leading-none text-white\">~35%</div><div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-white/75\">of billable time typically lost to coordination</div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"font-display text-[46px] font-semibold leading-none text-white\">~7 hrs</div><div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-white/75\">a week back per person, at a conservative win-back</div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"font-display text-[46px] font-semibold leading-none text-white\">~38 days</div><div class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-white/75\">of billable time back per person each year</div></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><p class=\"mx-auto mt-10 max-w-[700px] text-center text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-white/70\">Illustrative figures from our free ROI calculator using default assumptions, not customer averages.<!-- --> <a href=\"/tools/roi-calculator\" class=\"font-semibold text-white underline underline-offset-2\">Model your own firm</a>.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap max-w-[920px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-center\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>The difference</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">Why teams leave their old tracker.</h2></div></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full table-fixed border-collapse sm:table-auto\"><caption class=\"sr-only\">Feature comparison between a traditional project tracker and PYNGYN</caption><thead><tr class=\"bg-[#fafafe] text-left\"><th scope=\"col\" class=\"w-[24%] border-b border-line break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:w-auto sm:px-5\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Capability</span></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"border-b border-line break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5\"><span class=\"sm:hidden\">Old tracker</span><span class=\"hidden sm:inline\">Traditional tracker</span></th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"border-b border-line bg-accent-lt break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5\">PYNGYN</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-left text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5 border-b border-line\">Build the plan</th><td class=\"break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] text-muted sm:px-5 border-b border-line\"><span class=\"text-[#b9281f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✕</span> <!-- -->You enter every task by hand</td><td class=\"bg-accent-lt break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5 border-b border-line\"><span class=\"text-positive\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> <!-- -->AI drafts it from your goal</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-left text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5 border-b border-line\">Keep status current</th><td class=\"break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] text-muted sm:px-5 border-b border-line\"><span class=\"text-[#b9281f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✕</span> <!-- -->Manual updates &amp; chasing</td><td class=\"bg-accent-lt break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5 border-b border-line\"><span class=\"text-positive\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> <!-- -->Generated automatically</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-left text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5 border-b border-line\">Spot risk</th><td class=\"break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] text-muted sm:px-5 border-b border-line\"><span class=\"text-[#b9281f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✕</span> <!-- -->You notice when it&#x27;s late</td><td class=\"bg-accent-lt break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5 border-b border-line\"><span class=\"text-positive\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> <!-- -->Flagged before it slips</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-left text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5 \">Time to value</th><td class=\"break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] text-muted sm:px-5 \"><span class=\"text-[#b9281f]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✕</span> <!-- -->Hours of setup</td><td class=\"bg-accent-lt break-words px-3.5 py-4 text-center text-[13px] sm:text-[15px] font-semibold sm:px-5 \"><span class=\"text-positive\" aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span> <!-- -->Minutes</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"grid items-center gap-[54px] lg:grid-cols-2\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Connect your stack</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3\">Plugs into the tools you already use.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[480px] text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-muted\">PYNGYN sits at the center of your workflow. Connect your chat, email, code, and docs once, and plans, status, and updates flow where your team already works.</p><ul class=\"mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[15.5px]\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-lt text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>Connect once, no per-project setup or re-auth</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[15.5px]\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-lt text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>Works with chat, email, calendar, code, and docs</li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3 text-[15.5px]\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 flex-none place-items-center rounded-full bg-accent-lt text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path></svg></span>Status and updates flow to where your team already is</li></ul><a href=\"/demo\" class=\"btn btn-primary mt-8 w-fit\">Get started for free →</a></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto aspect-[600/340] w-full max-w-[520px]\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 340\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><g><path d=\"M 300 210 C 300 260, 60 240, 60 300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e9eaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><circle r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#c7c9d4\" offsetDistance=\"0%\" opacity=\"0\" style=\"offset-path:path(&quot;M 300 210 C 300 260, 60 240, 60 300&quot;)\"></circle></g><g><path d=\"M 300 210 C 300 260, 156 240, 156 300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e9eaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><circle r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#c7c9d4\" offsetDistance=\"0%\" opacity=\"0\" style=\"offset-path:path(&quot;M 300 210 C 300 260, 156 240, 156 300&quot;)\"></circle></g><g><path d=\"M 300 210 C 300 260, 252 240, 252 300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></path><circle r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#4f46e5\" offsetDistance=\"0%\" opacity=\"0\" style=\"offset-path:path(&quot;M 300 210 C 300 260, 252 240, 252 300&quot;)\"></circle></g><g><path d=\"M 300 210 C 300 260, 348 240, 348 300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e9eaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><circle r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#c7c9d4\" offsetDistance=\"0%\" opacity=\"0\" style=\"offset-path:path(&quot;M 300 210 C 300 260, 348 240, 348 300&quot;)\"></circle></g><g><path d=\"M 300 210 C 300 260, 444 240, 444 300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4f46e5\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"></path><circle r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#4f46e5\" offsetDistance=\"0%\" opacity=\"0\" style=\"offset-path:path(&quot;M 300 210 C 300 260, 444 240, 444 300&quot;)\"></circle></g><g><path d=\"M 300 210 C 300 260, 540 240, 540 300\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#e9eaf0\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path><circle r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#c7c9d4\" offsetDistance=\"0%\" opacity=\"0\" style=\"offset-path:path(&quot;M 300 210 C 300 260, 540 240, 540 300&quot;)\"></circle></g></svg><div class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-[44%] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2\"><span class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-[20px] bg-accent\"></span><div class=\"relative grid h-[clamp(52px,13vw,68px)] w-[clamp(52px,13vw,68px)] place-items-center rounded-[20px] border-2 border-accent bg-white shadow-cta\"><img alt=\"PYNGYN\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-2/3 w-2/3\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/icon.png\"/></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 flex w-full items-center justify-between\"><div class=\"grid h-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] w-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] place-items-center rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-card border-line\" title=\"Gmail\"><span class=\"grid h-[60%] w-[60%] place-items-center\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#4285f4\" d=\"M21.4 19h-2.9V9.9l-6.5 4.9-6.5-4.9V19H2.6c-.6 0-1-.5-1-1V6c0-.7.8-1.1 1.4-.7l9 6.8 9-6.8c.6-.4 1.4 0 1.4.7v12c0 .5-.4 1-1 1z\"></path><path fill=\"#34a853\" d=\"M1.6 18V6.6L5.5 9.5V19H2.6c-.6 0-1-.4-1-1z\"></path><path fill=\"#fbbc04\" d=\"M22.4 18c0 .6-.4 1-1 1h-2.9V9.5l3.9-2.9z\"></path><path fill=\"#ea4335\" d=\"M1.6 6c0-.7.8-1.1 1.4-.7l9 6.8 9-6.8c.6-.4 1.4 0 1.4.7l-1.4 1L12 14.8 2.6 6.7z\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"grid h-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] w-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] place-items-center rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-card border-line\" title=\"Slack\"><span class=\"grid h-[60%] w-[60%] place-items-center\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#36c5f0\" d=\"M6.8 14.7a2 2 0 11-2-2h2v2zm1 0a2 2 0 014 0v5a2 2 0 11-4 0v-5z\"></path><path fill=\"#2eb67d\" d=\"M9.8 6.8a2 2 0 11-2-2 2 2 0 012 2zm0 1a2 2 0 010 4h-5a2 2 0 110-4h5z\"></path><path fill=\"#ecb22e\" d=\"M17.2 9.8a2 2 0 112-2v2h-2zm-1 0a2 2 0 01-4 0v-5a2 2 0 114 0v5z\"></path><path fill=\"#e01e5a\" d=\"M14.2 17.2a2 2 0 112 2 2 2 0 01-2-2zm0-1a2 2 0 010-4h5a2 2 0 110 4h-5z\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"grid h-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] w-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] place-items-center rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-card border-accent\" title=\"Drive\"><span class=\"grid h-[60%] w-[60%] place-items-center\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"#ffba00\" d=\"M16.5 6L4 28l6 10 12.5-22z\"></path><path fill=\"#00ac47\" d=\"M31.5 6h-15l12.5 22h15z\"></path><path fill=\"#0066da\" d=\"M10 38h28l6-10H16z\"></path></svg></span></div><div class=\"grid h-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] w-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] place-items-center rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-card border-line\" title=\"QuickBooks\"><span class=\"grid h-[60%] w-[60%] place-items-center\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"#2ca01c\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><rect x=\"11\" y=\"12\" width=\"2\" height=\"6\" rx=\"1\" fill=\"#fff\"></rect></svg></span></div><div class=\"grid h-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] w-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] place-items-center rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-card border-accent\" title=\"Calendar\"><span class=\"grid h-[60%] w-[60%] place-items-center\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"10\" width=\"32\" height=\"30\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#4285f4\" stroke-width=\"3\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"10\" width=\"32\" height=\"8\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4285f4\"></rect><text x=\"24\" y=\"34\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#4285f4\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"Arial\">31</text></svg></span></div><div class=\"grid h-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] w-[clamp(40px,11vw,52px)] place-items-center rounded-2xl border bg-white shadow-card border-line\" title=\"n8n\"><span class=\"grid h-[60%] w-[60%] place-items-center\"><svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"5\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#ea4b71\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#ea4b71\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#ea4b71\"></circle><circle cx=\"19\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.4\" fill=\"#ea4b71\"></circle><path d=\"M7 12h3M14 8.5l3 2.2M14 15.5l3-2.2\" stroke=\"#ea4b71\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap max-w-[800px] text-center\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><span class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"eyebrow-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Security &amp; trust</span><h2 class=\"title mt-3 text-[clamp(26px,3vw,36px)]\">Enterprise-grade, by default.</h2><p class=\"lead mx-auto mt-4\">Your data is encrypted, never sold, and never used to train models without your consent.</p></div><div class=\"mt-[30px] flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3.5\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-positive\">✓</span> <!-- -->SOC 2 aligned</span></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-positive\">✓</span> <!-- -->GDPR compliant</span></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-positive\">✓</span> <!-- -->Encrypted in transit &amp; at rest</span></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px)\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-line bg-white px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-card\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-positive\">✓</span> <!-- -->SSO / SAML</span></div></div></div></section><section id=\"pricing\" class=\"section\"><div class=\"w